  <2>20. CASE TerminalCallbackReturns(c2)
          BY <2>0, <2>20, SMT DEF  TerminalCallbackReturns,
           L1!DeliveryCallbackReturns, L1!L0!HasStatus, PayloadOwed,
           L1!HostOwnsSomePayload, L1!OwedPayloads, RingDrained, RingHead,
